今天的饮食热量是否合理，都可以直接告诉我哦~","createdAt":"2026-05-09T07:36:55.117Z","kind":"text","id":"2BEBDECB-369D-4213-9EB8-3E396EEF5CD1","updatedAt":"2026-05-09T07:37:00.172Z"}]},{"thread_id":"a984bccd-73f5-48fc-9dec-7150cfbe608f","role":"user","model_name":"user","client_message_id":"380f7d61-b4b9-47ad-8dd1-7210be2c0586","delivery_state":"pending","created_at":"2026-05-09 07:37:18.425000+00:00","tombstone":false,"thread_current_model_name":"doubao-seed-2-0-pro-260215","thread_temperature":0.6,"thread_top_p":1.0,"thread_max_tokens":4096,"thread_max_messages":20,"thread_role_prompt":"你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}","thread_system_prompt":"你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}","blocks":[{"text":"给我选项","updatedAt":"2026-05-09T07:37:18.425Z","id":"CF50333C-2868-4A80-ADBA-90780095F681","kind":"text","createdAt":"2026-05-09T07:37:18.425Z"}]}]}
